<section class="auth-layout"><div class="auth-story"><div class="section-overline">A LITTLE LOCAL. A LITTLE CLOSER.</div><h1>Good to have<br><span>you back.</span></h1><p>Your saved finds, your seller studio and your next campus connection. All in one place.</p><img src="/assets/hero-scene.svg" alt="Burgundy Pasor Kita shopping bag"></div><div class="surface auth-form"><h2>A little closer to campus</h2><p>New around here? <a href="/register">Create an account ↗</a></p><form action="/login" method="post"><%- include('../partials/csrf') %><input type="hidden" name="next" value="<%= typeof query.next==='string'?query.next:'/account' %>"><label>University email<input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="username" maxlength="190" placeholder="you@student.uthm.edu.my" required></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></label><button type="submit" class="primary-button full-width">Sign in ↗</button></form><p class="quiet-note">Your personal account can also manage linked campus businesses.</p></div></section>
